{
  "job_B19.4_20251003_114443": {
    "text": "MY02A1 On \u00f0one \u00e6fterran d\u00e6g \u00fe\u00e6s mon\u00f0es bi\u00fe \u00f0\u00e6s halgan biscopes gemynd Sancte Athanasi.\nMY02A2 He uu\u00e6s biscop in \u00f0\u00e6re miclan ceastre Alexandria.\nMY02A3 His halignes uu\u00e6s foretacnad on his cneahthade.\nMY02A3 \u00de\u00e6re burge biscop \u00e6r him w\u00e6s nemned Alexandre, se s\u00e6t sume symbeld\u00e6ge in \u00f0\u00e6re\nMY02A6 \u00dea ongon he fulwian \u00f0a o\u00feere cneahtas on \u00fe\u00e6s s\u00e6s y\u00feum, & hie eodan him under hond sua he\nMY02A7 & \u00f0a sona heht se biscop \u00feone cneht him to gel\u00e6dan, & hine l\u00e6rde gastlicne wisdom, & he\nMY03A1 On \u00f0one \u00feriddan d\u00e6g \u00f0\u00e6s mon\u00f0es bi\u00f0 Sancte Alexandres \u00ferowung, \u00fe\u00e6s iungan papan, in\nMY03A4 \u00d0a Aurelianus se gesi\u00f0 se \u00f0\u00e6r cualde Cristene menn, \u00fea ongon he hie n\u00e6dan \u00f0\u00e6t hie Criste\nMY03A5 \u00d0a hie \u00f0\u00e6t ne ge\u00f0afodan, \u00fea heht he sendan hie alle \u00ferie in bernendne ofn.\nMY03A6 \u00dea nolde hie \u00f0\u00e6t fyr no b\u00e6rnan, \u00f0a heht he \u00f0a m\u00e6ssepreostas beheafdian & \u00feone papan\nMY03A7 \u00dea sona cuom stefn of heofonum & seo cu\u00e6\u00f0, Aurelianus, \u00f0eossum monnum \u00fee \u00f0u her\nMY03A9 \u00d0a sualt he sona \u00f0\u00e6re ilcan neaht mid egeslice dea\u00f0e, & his wiif, sio w\u00e6s on noman\nMY03A13 \u00d0es Sanctus Alexandre uu\u00e6s se fifta papa \u00e6fter Sancte Petre.\nMY03B1 On \u00f0one ilcan d\u00e6g bi\u00fe sio tiid \u00f0\u00e6t Cristes rod uu\u00e6s gemeted \u00e6rest, sua us \u00f0a halgan\nMY03B2 \u00d0\u00e6r cuom upp of \u00f0\u00e6re eor\u00f0an wynsumes stences rec, \u00fe\u00e6r sio rod uu\u00e6s gemeted.\nMY03B3 \u00d0\u00e6t treow uu\u00e6s aseted ofer deades monnes byrgenne & lichoman, & se sona aras, & \u00feurh\nMY03B6 Ymb \u00feas dagas utan, hwilum \u00e6r, hwilum \u00e6fter, bio\u00f0 \u00f0a \u00ferie dagas on \u00f0am Godes ciercean &\nMY04A1 Gelic agoten fore allum monnum.\nMY04A1 On \u00f0am \u00ferim dagum Cristene menn sceolon al\u00e6tan hiera \u00fea woroldlican weorc on \u00f0a\nMY04A6 \u00dea dagas siendan ryhtlice to gef\u00e6stanne, & \u00f0ara metta to brucanne \u00fee menn bruca\u00fe on \u00f0\u00e6t\nMY04A9 \u00d0as \u00ferie dagas siendan monnes saule l\u00e6cedom & gastlic wyrtdrenc, for\u00feon hie siendon to\nMY05A1 On \u00f0one fiftan d\u00e6g \u00fe\u00e6s mon\u00f0es bi\u00f0 se d\u00e6g \u00fee ure Dryhten on to hiofonum astag.\nMY05A2 \u00dey d\u00e6ge hine gesegon nest his \u00feegnas on Oliuetes dune, \u00f0\u00e6r he bletsade hie & \u00f0a gewat mid\nMY05A3 \u00dey d\u00e6ge eode sio eor\u00f0e in heofon, \u00fe\u00e6t is se monn ofer \u00e6ngla \u00f0rym, & on Oliuetes dune\nMY05A5 Ymb \u00fea Dryhtnes fotl\u00e6stas timbredon Cristene menn sionowalte ciercean wundorlice.\nMY05A6 Ond ne meahte sio his sua\u00feu n\u00e6fre mid n\u00e6nigre o\u00f0erre wisan bion \u00feam o\u00f0erum flore\nMY05A8 Gif \u00f0\u00e6r monn hw\u00e6t mennisces on asette, \u00feonne nolde sio eor\u00f0e him onfon, \u00f0eah hit w\u00e6re\nMY05A10 \u00d0\u00e6t dust \u00fe\u00e6t God \u00fe\u00e6r on tr\u00e6d & \u00f0a his sua\u00fee \u00fee \u00f0\u00e6r on a\u00f0rycced siondon w\u00e6ron monnum\nMY05A14 Sancte Arculuos s\u00ebgde \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0\u00e6r ne meahte n\u00e6nig hrof bion on \u00f0\u00e6re ciercean in \u00fe\u00e6re stowe\nMY05A17 Heannes w\u00e6re o\u00f0 monnes suioran, & \u00f0\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6r w\u00e6re \u00f0yrel onmiddum \u00feam hweole, \u00feurh\nMY05A20 Ond Sanctus Arculuos s\u00e6gde \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0\u00e6r hongade unm\u00e6te leohtf\u00e6t, & \u00f0\u00e6t w\u00e6re biernende a\nMY05A22 Ond he s\u00e6gde \u00f0\u00e6t \u00e6ghwelce geare \u00f0y d\u00e6ge \u00e6t Cristes uppastignesse on middes d\u00e6ges tiid,\nMY05A28 Se ondrysnlica wind \u00f0\u00e6t de\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t se del \u00fe\u00e6re ciercean ne m\u00e6g habban \u00f0one hrof \u00fe\u00e6r \u00f0\u00e6s\nMY05A30 Sancte Arculuos s\u00e6gde \u00fe\u00e6t he seolf \u00fe\u00e6r w\u00e6re ondweard \u00e6t \u00f0\u00e6re ilcan ciercean \u00fey d\u00e6ge\nMY06A1 On \u00f0one sextan d\u00e6g \u00fe\u00e6s mon\u00f0es bi\u00f0 Sancte Eadbrehtes geleornes \u00fe\u00e6s arwyr\u00f0an f\u00e6der, se\nMY06A4 \u00d0am Eadbrehte uu\u00e6s gewunelic \u00fe\u00e6t he symle feowertig daga \u00e6r Eastran & eac feowertig\nMY06A7 \u00dea on \u00fe\u00e6t lenctenf\u00e6sten, on \u00f0am \u00fe\u00e6s mynstres bro\u00f0or dydon Sancte Cu\u00febrehtes lic of\nMY06A14 He \u00fe\u00e6t sele\u00f0 \u00feam \u00f0e hiene lufia\u00f0 \u00f0\u00e6t \u00fea saula lifia\u00f0 a in ecnesse & in \u00f0\u00e6re hiofonlican\nMY06A16 \u00c6mettegu \u00fee Sancte Cu\u00f0brehtes lichoma in reste\u00f0, & \u00f0\u00e6t bi\u00f0 sui\u00f0e eadig monn \u00feam \u00fee\nMY06A17 Ond \u00fea noht longe \u00e6fter \u00feeossum, \u00fea geuntrumode Godes se leofa Eadbreht biscop, & \u00f0as\nMY07A1 On \u00feone seofo\u00fean d\u00e6g \u00fe\u00e6s mon\u00f0es bi\u00f0 Sancte Iohanes geleornes, se uu\u00e6s biscop in Bretone\nMY07A2 Se gedyde dumbum menn spr\u00e6ce, & his wundor siendan awriten on Istoria Anglorum on\nMY08A1 On \u00feone eahto\u00f0an d\u00e6g \u00fe\u00e6s mon\u00f0es bi\u00fe \u00f0\u00e6t Sancte Michaheles cierce \u00e6rest funden uu\u00e6s\nMY08B1 On \u00feone ilcan d\u00e6g bi\u00fe Sancte Uictores \u00ferowung, \u00f0\u00e6s martyres, \u00fe\u00e6s lichoma reste\u00f0 in\nMY08B2 Se Uictores he uu\u00e6s Maura cynnes, & he uu\u00e6s Maximianes cempa, \u00fe\u00e6s h\u00e6\u00f0nan caseres,\nMY08B4 \u00dea l\u00e6rde se casere hine \u00f0\u00e6t he forlete Cristes geleafan.\nMY08B4 \u00dea he \u00fe\u00e6t ne ge\u00f0afo\u00f0e, \u00fea \u00fereade he hine mid witum.\nMY08B5 He heht hine begeotan mid wallende leade, ah him \u00fe\u00e6t noht ne \u00f0erede \u00f0e ma \u00f0e cald\nMY08B6 \u00d0a heht he his leaseras hine l\u00e6\u00f0an to \u00feam wuda se is geceged Dulmis, & hiene \u00f0\u00e6r\nMY08B7 \u00dea cu\u00e6\u00fe he to \u00feam \u00fee hine l\u00e6ddon, Secga\u00f0 ge Maximiane \u00fe\u00e6m casere \u00fe\u00e6t he bi\u00f0 to geare\nMY08B10 & \u00fea bebead se casere \u00f0\u00e6t n\u00e6nig monn his lichoman bebyrgde si\u00f0\u00fean he uu\u00e6s\nMY08B12 \u00dea cuomon tu wildu dior & heoldon \u00feone lichoman, o\u00f0er \u00e6t \u00feam heafdum, o\u00f0er \u00e6t \u00f0am\nMY09A1 On \u00feone niogo\u00f0an d\u00e6g \u00fe\u00e6s mon\u00f0es bi\u00fe sumeres fruma.\nMY09A1 Se sumor hafa\u00f0 hund niogontig daga, \u00f0onne gonga\u00f0 \u00fea seofon steorran on uhtan upp & on\nMY10A1 On \u00feone teoge\u00f0an d\u00e6g \u00fe\u00e6s mon\u00f0es bi\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6s martyres tiid Sancti Gordiani.",
